OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 15 APR
OL,4,G0500FEmily Pilbeam
OL,5,     GEmily sits in with the early
OL,6,     Gmorning breakfast show and chats
OL,7,     Gto Aiden of Group A.D. Plus, we
OL,8,     Gstop-down for the mid-week
OL,9,     GFactory Reset tune, chosen by you.
OL,10,G0700FNick Grimshaw
OL,11,     GLegendary singer Jocelyn Brown
OL,12,     Gjoins Nick to chat about her
OL,13,     Gglittering career. And as always,
OL,14,     GNick has the Cloudbusting mix -
OL,15,     Gan hour of uplifting tunes to
OL,16,     Gbanish the grey skies.
OL,17,G1000FLauren Laverne
OL,18,     GLauren gives you the finest blend
OL,19,     Gof fantastic music for your
OL,20,     Gweekday morning.
